#%Module1.0

module-whatis           "validating XML parser written in C++"
module-url              "https://xerces.apache.org/xerces-c/"
module-license          "Apache License 2.0"
module-maintainer       "Marc Caubet Serrabou <marc.caubet@psi.ch>"
module-help             "
Apache Xerces-C++ is a validating XML parser written in a portable subset
of C++. It provides a shared library for parsing, generating, manipulating
and validating XML documents.

Xerces-C++ supports the XML 1.0 and XML 1.1 recommendations and associated
standards, including XML Schema and DOM.

As an example, Xerces-C++ is used by Geant4 to provide GDML geometry
import and export support through G4GDMLParser.
"
